# crontab entries
# see: https://github.com/OSGeo/grass-addons/tree/grass8/utils/cronjobs_osgeo_lxd/

# add GRASS jobs here and then run on `grasslxd`server:
# crontab $HOME/cronjobs/cron_job_list_grass && crontab -l

#MAILTO=neteler@osgeo.org
#STDOUT=/dev/null

# +---------------- minute (0 - 59)
# |  +------------- hour (0 - 23)
# |  |  +---------- day of month (1 - 31)
# |  |  |  +------- month (1 - 12)
# |  |  |  |  +---- day of week (0 - 6) (Sunday=0 or 7)
# |  |  |  |  |
# *  *  *  *  *  command to be executed

#################################################################
## Note: - hugo based web pages and manual pages are separate jobs!
##       - both are build in the GitHub CI, downloaded on grass.osgeo.org and unpacked (see below)
#################################################################

### HUGO website (https://crontab.guru/#0_*/6_*_*_*)
# run every 6 hs at xx:00, each day: fetches website page package from GitHub and unpacks it (target dir: /var/www/html/)
0 */6 * * * nice bash /home/neteler/cronjobs/hugo_clean_and_update_job.sh

### MANUAL pages
# run every 6 hs at xx:00, each day:
30 */6 * * * nice bash /home/neteler/cronjobs/fetch_unpack_manual_GHA.sh > /home/neteler/fetch_unpack_manual_GHA.log  2>&1

### SOURCE CODE snapshot packages
# weekly source snapshots (target dir: /var/www/code_and_data/)
